Error [E0711]: the capability `caps` can't escape its `#Grant` block
  --> tests/ui/grant_handle_escapes.jet:6:18
    |
  6 |         alias #= caps;
    |                  ^^^^
 Why: `#Grant(…)` revokes the capability at the end of its block (RAII); returning, storing, or sharing `caps` would let a revoked authority outlive the grant
 Fix: use `caps` only inside the `#Grant` block, or perform the work there
